WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:07.560 size:78% align:center
Today, in the age of AI, automating a workflow from start to finish is a reality.

2
00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:10.210 size:78% align:center
Let's look at a real case from one of my clients.

3
00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:14.950 size:78% align:center
My client wanted to automate selling the virtual currency of

4
00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:18.190 size:78% align:center
a massive online game to one of the many sites that buy it.

5
00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:21.670 size:78% align:center
Until then, the whole process was done by hand.

6
00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:23.760 size:78% align:center
The proposal:

7
00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:26.190 size:78% align:center
software that scrapes the prices of the servers

8
00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:28.900 size:78% align:center
my client cares about on three of these sites.

9
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.980 size:78% align:center
With that data, the same software makes the decisions,

10
00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:36.860 size:78% align:center
following my client's own rules: a minimum selling price and the amount to sell.

11
00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:41.520 size:78% align:center
Prices are monitored 24/7, checking every minute.

12
00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:47.970 size:78% align:center
When it finds a match, it first asks my client on Telegram whether to go ahead,

13
00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:49.530 size:78% align:center
with a summary of the deal.

14
00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:54.530 size:78% align:center
If the answer is yes, the script triggers the sale:

15
00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:58.800 size:78% align:center
a bot opens a browser in the background, logs in to the buyer's site,

16
00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:01.790 size:78% align:center
fills in the details and creates the sell order.

17
00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:06.590 size:78% align:center
Once the order is created, a bot waits on standby with the order's details,

18
00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:10.890 size:78% align:center
server and amount, until the site's staff contacts it to take the delivery.

19
00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:16.240 size:78% align:center
When the delivery is done, the bot tells my client the operation was successful,

20
00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:18.040 size:78% align:center
with a summary of the transaction.

21
00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:21.840 size:78% align:center
All my client has to do is check that the site's payment arrived.
